From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivo Nunes <ivo@nunes.uk>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 22:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] visionOS: use TRACKER_CAMERA for the head tracker

XRServer::TRACKER_HEAD is a deprecated alias of TRACKER_CAMERA, only
defined without DISABLE_DEPRECATED, so the visionOS XR module didn't
build with deprecated=no (as Purr builds every template). The value is
the same.

Test: scons platform=visionos target=template_debug deprecated=no
builds.

Upstream: to propose (still in master).
---
 godot/modules/visionos_xr/visionos_xr_interface.mm | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/godot/modules/visionos_xr/visionos_xr_interface.mm b/godot/modules/visionos_xr/visionos_xr_interface.mm
index 0e919003..fb17d8c1 100644
--- a/godot/modules/visionos_xr/visionos_xr_interface.mm
+++ b/godot/modules/visionos_xr/visionos_xr_interface.mm
@@ -229,7 +229,7 @@
 
 	// Head tracker initialization
 	head_tracker.instantiate();
-	head_tracker->set_tracker_type(XRServer::TRACKER_HEAD);
+	head_tracker->set_tracker_type(XRServer::TRACKER_CAMERA);
 	head_tracker->set_tracker_name("head");
 	head_tracker->set_tracker_desc("Device head pose");
 	p_xr_server->add_tracker(head_tracker);
-- 
